<BaseLayout title="Contact and Corrections" description="Report a reproducible tool problem or source correction to Seller Operations Lab." noindex activeNav="/about/">
  <section class="legal-hero legal-shell"><p class="eyebrow">SELLER OPERATIONS LAB</p><h1>Contact and corrections</h1><p>Use the public issue tracker for reproducible technical problems and source corrections.</p></section>
  <section class="legal-content legal-shell"><p><a class="button" href="https://github.com/huynjuunn-glitch/Milo/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open a GitHub issue</a></p><h2>Include enough detail to reproduce it</h2><ul><li>Page URL, browser and operating system</li><li>Input type, dimensions and approximate size</li><li>Output settings and exact message</li><li>What you expected and what happened</li></ul><p>Do not attach private photos, customer details or confidential business information. Reports are public. There is currently no private support inbox, so do not send sensitive data through the tracker.</p><h2>Source corrections</h2><p>Include the passage, the linked source and the specific correction. We do not promise a response time.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>
